{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/d1290040c0a34c2c90575f84837b14de.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/d1290040c0a34c2c90575f84837b14de.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/d1290040c0a34c2c90575f84837b14de.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic dark fantasy world, mythologies lie in ruins. This blend of Extraction and Action RPG challenges you to restore balance to the shattered realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruited by Death, you\u2019ll enter dangerous maps, complete objectives, fight enemies or other players, and secure your loot.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/854c388e8281ca2d395dade2d16d7879.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/854c388e8281ca2d395dade2d16d7879.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/854c388e8281ca2d395dade2d16d7879.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through mythological realms, beginning with Norse mythology. Face tough enemies, take on quests, and gather powerful gear and artifacts. Master different playstyles in a fair game environment with strict anti-cheat tools.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/5b884de87c0be365f753c59fc237708c.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/5b884de87c0be365f753c59fc237708c.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/5b884de87c0be365f753c59fc237708c.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from your hidden fortress, where you upgrade your base, customize loadouts, and prepare for battle. Each map offers unique objectives and treasures, but the stakes are high: die and lose everything, or extract and keep your rewards. Future updates will add new maps, player-to-player trading, and extra modes for different playstyles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/9d190b2222a8101b473ac02f30080fd9.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/9d190b2222a8101b473ac02f30080fd9.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/9d190b2222a8101b473ac02f30080fd9.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the high-stakes Reaper-vs-Reaper-vs-Environment extraction mode, you\u2019ll get more ways to play. A single-player story mode lets you uncover the mystery of the dead gods at your own pace, without risking your gear. Or choose the PvE co-op mode that will allow you to team up to fight factions and uncover more of the story. Both modes will be added in an upcoming update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/8f737ad3263a6274b25f111f9b3ab011.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/8f737ad3263a6274b25f111f9b3ab011.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/8f737ad3263a6274b25f111f9b3ab011.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with players in mind, we\u2019re committed to community-driven development and real feedback. Closed Alpha testers help refine the game and shape its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to take part? Join our Discord to stay updated and share your ideas.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3086590?t=1764006710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/70495481315918b9ef159b667c7077b2c8e28610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764006710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/847cb7c9dcf495cec6833af9ba54937b94f6ff1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764006710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/847cb7c9dcf495cec6833af9ba54937b94f6ff1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764006710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/d1290040c0a34c2c90575f84837b14de.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/d1290040c0a34c2c90575f84837b14de.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/d1290040c0a34c2c90575f84837b14de.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic dark fantasy world, mythologies lie in ruins. This blend of Extraction and Action RPG challenges you to restore balance to the shattered realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruited by Death, you\u2019ll enter dangerous maps, complete objectives, fight enemies or other players, and secure your loot.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/854c388e8281ca2d395dade2d16d7879.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/854c388e8281ca2d395dade2d16d7879.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/854c388e8281ca2d395dade2d16d7879.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through mythological realms, beginning with Norse mythology. Face tough enemies, take on quests, and gather powerful gear and artifacts. Master different playstyles in a fair game environment with strict anti-cheat tools.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/5b884de87c0be365f753c59fc237708c.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/5b884de87c0be365f753c59fc237708c.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/5b884de87c0be365f753c59fc237708c.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from your hidden fortress, where you upgrade your base, customize loadouts, and prepare for battle. Each map offers unique objectives and treasures, but the stakes are high: die and lose everything, or extract and keep your rewards. Future updates will add new maps, player-to-player trading, and extra modes for different playstyles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/9d190b2222a8101b473ac02f30080fd9.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/9d190b2222a8101b473ac02f30080fd9.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/9d190b2222a8101b473ac02f30080fd9.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the high-stakes Reaper-vs-Reaper-vs-Environment extraction mode, you\u2019ll get more ways to play. A single-player story mode lets you uncover the mystery of the dead gods at your own pace, without risking your gear. Or choose the PvE co-op mode that will allow you to team up to fight factions and uncover more of the story. Both modes will be added in an upcoming update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/8f737ad3263a6274b25f111f9b3ab011.poster.avif?t=1764006710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/8f737ad3263a6274b25f111f9b3ab011.webm?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/8f737ad3263a6274b25f111f9b3ab011.mp4?t=1764006710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with players in mind, we\u2019re committed to community-driven development and real feedback. Closed Alpha testers help refine the game and shape its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to take part? Join our Discord to stay updated and share your ideas.</p>","developers":["WOLCEN Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/0f210431d6be172e5e8a807f0c044fec8e699eea/header.jpg?t=1764006710","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stron